# Milestone 2 (X5): the update notice in the bottom bar, its right-click menu, the Updates settings page and the
# snooze, dark theme, 1280x720. `update serve` starts the REAL update service against a loopback manifest announcing
# 9.9.9 (QA runs never leave the machine), so every step goes through the code a release build uses.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
update serve 9.9.9 https://example.com/gitcthulhu/releases/v9.9.9
wait idle
assert update notice 9.9.9
shot m2-update-01-welcome-notice
open repository linear
wait idle
shot m2-update-02-repository-notice
open update menu
wait idle
shot m2-update-03-notice-menu
close menu
open settings page updates
wait idle
shot m2-update-04-updates-page
update check
wait idle
shot m2-update-05-check-now
close dialog
update snooze 24
wait idle
assert update notice none
shot m2-update-06-snoozed
assert no error
